emy-id "q-51135" :question/problem "Given that\n\n$$\n\\frac{4x+2}{(x+2)(x-1)}=\\frac{A}{(x+2)}+\\frac{2}{(x-1)},\n$$\n\nwhat is the value of $A?$" :question/worked-solution "Our task is to find $A$ such that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4x+2}{(x+2)(x-1)}=\\frac{A}{(x+2)}+\\frac{2}{(x-1)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying both sides by $(x+2)(x-1)$ gives\n\n$$\n4x+2=A(x-1)+2(x+2).\n$$\n\nFor $x=-2$, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4(-2)+2 & =A(-2-1)+2(-2+2) \\\\ -6 & =-3A \\\\ A & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-51135/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "450aebfe-d896-50bc-a392-e43aee7afabd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-51135"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-350931/field-1/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "6eaec457-6db1-5d88-b4e1-668beca0dbda" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-350931/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "1dd8ee49-ab79-5d64-b880-a2134d9614c2" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-350931/field-1/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer-field/choices ["q-350931/field-1/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-350931" :question/id #uuid "25acd6fd-eb49-59cd-9aef-224c06bf3730" :question/math-academy-id "q-350931" :question/problem "Express $\\frac{10}{(2x+1)(x+3)}$ as a sum of partial fractions.\n\n| $\\frac{10}{(2x+1)(x+3)}=\\,$ | {{field-1}} | $-$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $2x+1$ |  | $x+3$ |" :question/worked-solution "Our task is to find $A$ such that\n\n$$\n\\frac{10}{(2x+1)(x+3)}=\\frac{A}{2x+1}-\\frac{2}{x+3}.\n$$\n\nMultiplying both sides by $(2x+1)(x+3)$ gives\n\n$$\n10=A(x+3)-2(2x+1).\n$$\n\nFor $x=-\\frac{1}{2}$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}10 & =A(-\\frac{1}{2}+3)-2(2(-\\frac{1}{2})+1) \\\\ 10 & =\\frac{5}{2}A \\\\ A & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{10}{(2x+1)(x+3)}=\\frac{4}{2x+1}-\\frac{2}{x+3}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-350931/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "450aebfe-d896-50bc-a392-e43aee7afabd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-350931"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-51134/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer/id #uuid "f58ab48d-6efb-5194-8a0c-3fc07963b41c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51134/selection/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer/id #uuid "0f4124b3-ba37-5bc6-87ef-d767239cdd8f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51134/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer/id #uuid "fb49341c-e5a0-5078-9e91-416283deef2a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51134/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "7bbf1b11-7e38-5df9-a625-cf79961197f3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51134/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "9569eac9-b380-56b7-afcc-094e36985865" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51134/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "4643346c-4500-5161-82f3-25fd5e645f08" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-51134/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer-field/choices ["q-51134/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" "q-51134/selection/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" "q-51134/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" "q-51134/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" "q-51134/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-51134" :question/id #uuid "1aff61a9-3c45-524d-a03d-a987466456b2" :question/math-academy-id "q-51134" :question/problem "Given that\n\n$$\n\\frac{x+5}{(x-1)(x+1)}=\\frac{3}{(x-1)}+\\frac{B}{(x+1)},\n$$\n\nwhat is the value of $B?$" :question/worked-solution "Our task is to find $B$ such that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{x+5}{(x-1)(x+1)}=\\frac{3}{(x-1)}+\\frac{B}{(x+1)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying both sides by $(x-1)(x+1)$ gives\n\n$$\nx+5=3(x+1)+B(x-1).\n$$\n\nFor $x=-1$, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-1)+5 & =3(-1+1)+B(-1-1) \\\\ 4 & =-2B \\\\ B & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-51134/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "450aebfe-d896-50bc-a392-e43aee7afabd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-51134"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-10940/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "5b76a96e-e5a6-5d86-a602-3fdbdef26d27" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10940/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "b54bf81a-3d1f-54b2-97a2-2591a7cd0cfd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10940/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer/id #uuid "da14403d-82b6-580c-a1ee-317936037b0f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10940/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e