sy :question/answer-fields ["q-10940/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "450aebfe-d896-50bc-a392-e43aee7afabd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-10940"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-10974/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer/id #uuid "3e25788b-7544-5f2b-9242-937076aff43b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10974/selection/10293ac0295e0e79554137a949f5c5c46b9812dcc0a3ecb6349c4cb5e6acdff3" :answer/id #uuid "98c323c9-b4b7-55de-b8fb-b1fc59ed12ce" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10974/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "3d30d3f4-7110-5d7a-94f1-05de257882c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10974/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "c348aa84-f04d-5685-8e7d-055cf33fe3ce" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10974/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer/id #uuid "db33c0c3-efd2-5101-8afc-0e00d60594ac" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10974/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "dc4fc8d6-5aac-5a3d-a9b2-82befae980c0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-10974/selection/10293ac0295e0e79554137a949f5c5c46b9812dcc0a3ecb6349c4cb5e6acdff3" :answer-field/choices ["q-10974/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" "q-10974/selection/10293ac0295e0e79554137a949f5c5c46b9812dcc0a3ecb6349c4cb5e6acdff3" "q-10974/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" "q-10974/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" "q-10974/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-10974" :question/id #uuid "ca8ed292-7934-54b0-b0fb-7d888622b0ad" :question/math-academy-id "q-10974" :question/problem "Given that\n\n$$\n\\frac{7x-37}{(5-3x)(2x+3)}=\\frac{A}{(5-3x)}+\\frac{B}{(2x+3)},\n$$\n\nwhere $A$ and $B$ are real constants, calculate $A+B.$" :question/worked-solution "Our task is to find $A$ and $B$ such that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7x-37}{(5-3x)(2x+3)}=\\frac{A}{(5-3x)}+\\frac{B}{(2x+3)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying both sides by $(5-3x)(2x+3)$ gives\n\n$$\n7x-37=A(2x+3)+B(5-3x).\n$$\n\nFor $x=-\\frac{3}{2}$, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7(-\\frac{3}{2})-37 & =A(2(-\\frac{3}{2})+3)+B(5-3(-\\frac{3}{2})) \\\\ \\frac{-21-74}{2} & =B(\\frac{10+9}{2}) \\\\ \\frac{-95}{2} & =B(\\frac{19}{2}) \\\\ B & =\\frac{-95}{19} \\\\ B & =-5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $x=\\frac{5}{3}$, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7(\\frac{5}{3})-37 & =A(2(\\frac{5}{3})+3)+B(5-3(\\frac{5}{3})) \\\\ \\frac{35-111}{3} & =A(\\frac{10+9}{3}) \\\\ A & =\\frac{-76}{19} \\\\ A & =-4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\nA+B=-4+(-5)=-4-5=-9.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-10974/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "450aebfe-d896-50bc-a392-e43aee7afabd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-10974"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-69752/selection/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer/id #uuid "c484e8cf-c6d6-52f3-bf22-ea04e4d1b100" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-69752/selection/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer/id #uuid "91842c4e-8b37-5660-9941-10d45936a344" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-69752/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed8