et \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2{(\\frac{1}{4})}^{2}+29(\\frac{1}{4})+1 & =A(\\frac{1}{4}+3)(\\frac{1}{4}+1) \\\\  & \\,+B(4(\\frac{1}{4})-1)(\\frac{1}{4}+1) \\\\  & \\,+C(4(\\frac{1}{4})-1)(\\frac{1}{4}+3) \\\\ -\\frac{1}{8}+\\frac{29}{4}+1 & =A(\\frac{65}{16}) \\\\ \\frac{65}{8} & =A(\\frac{65}{16}) \\\\ A & =\\frac{16}{8} \\\\ A & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $x=-3$, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2(-3)^{2}+29(-3)+1 & =A(-3+3)(-3+1) \\\\  & \\,+B(4(-3)-1)(-3+1) \\\\  & \\,+C(4(-3)-1)(-3+3) \\\\ -18-87+1 & =B(-13)(-2) \\\\ B & =\\frac{-104}{26} \\\\ B & =-4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $x=-1$, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2(-1)^{2}+29(-1)+1 & =A(-1+3)(-1+1) \\\\  & \\,+B(4(-1)-1)(-1+1) \\\\  & \\,+C(4(-1)-1)(-1+3) \\\\ -2-29+1 & =C(-5)(2) \\\\ C & =\\frac{-30}{-10} \\\\ C & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n\\frac{-2{x}^{2}+29x+1}{(4x-1)(x+3)(x+1)}=\\frac{2}{(4x-1)}-\\frac{4}{(x+3)}+\\frac{3}{(x+1)}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-69820/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7e66d7cf-1a4b-51e6-9c78-f70a8c0555df"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-69820"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-86185/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "4b393a8e-4a97-5c39-97e3-b6ba533e0267" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-86185/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "5cd3541c-f52c-516a-937f-88e8a461a160" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-86185/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "dfcca86c-09c0-5ac7-86af-47f8dc71e6f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-86185/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #