d}3(4)^{2}+15(4) & =A(4+2)(2(4)+1) \\\\  & \\,+B(4-4)(2(4)+1) \\\\  & \\,+C(4-4)(4+2) \\\\ 48+60 & =A(6)(9) \\\\ 108 & =54A \\\\ A & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $x=-\\frac{1}{2}$, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{(-\\frac{1}{2})}^{2}+15(-\\frac{1}{2}) & =A(-\\frac{1}{2}+2)(2(-\\frac{1}{2})+1) \\\\  & \\,+B(-\\frac{1}{2}-4)(2(-\\frac{1}{2})+1) \\\\  & \\,+C(-\\frac{1}{2}-4)(-\\frac{1}{2}+2) \\\\ \\frac{3}{4}-\\frac{15}{2} & =C(-\\frac{9}{2})(\\frac{3}{2}) \\\\ -\\frac{27}{4} & =-\\frac{27}{4}C \\\\ C & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A+B+C & =2+(-1)+1=2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-86185/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7e66d7cf-1a4b-51e6-9c78-f70a8c0555df"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-86185"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-10988/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "72266f04-2ce9-5cc0-b94a-259d7536aca5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10988/selection/25666b67a56594dd5245ec05e89d883db07d04362ab51dbc90c39ad20f7f9142" :answer/id #uuid "90a7a256-59ae-55cd-8d2b-b5ebb7b49fc1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10988/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" :answer/id #uuid "8be77c94-126f-5205-8e6a-5871590a71aa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10988/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "73783661-63f3-5253-94fd-8a09c1e7de0f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10988/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "7990c164-2852-5090-b078-7a0559544676" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10988/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "c5e321b9-5af2-5635-9842-e9d3a66ea8da" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-10988/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer-field/choices ["q-10988/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" "q-10988/selection/25666b67a56594dd5245ec05e89d883db07d04362ab51dbc90c39ad20f7f9142" "q-10988/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" "q-10988/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" "q-10988/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-10988" :question/id #uuid "58617aa9-7162-5aab-b876-c11d9c41851e" :question/math-academy-id "q-10988" :question/problem "Given that\n\n$$\n\\frac{13{x}^{2}-19x-16}{(3x+2)(x-3)(x+1)}=\\frac{A}{(3x+2)}+\\frac{B}{(x-3)}+\\frac{C}{(x+1)},\n$$\n\nwhere $A,$ $B$ and $C$ are real constants, calculate $A+B+C.$" :question/worked-solution "Our task is to find $A,$ $B$ and $C$ such that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{13{x}^{2}-19x-16}{(3x+2)(x-3)(x+1)}=\\frac{A}{(3x+2)}+\\frac{B}{(x-3)}+\\frac{C}{(x+1)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying both sides by $(3x+2)(x-3)(x+1)$ gives\n\n$$\n13{x}^{2}-19x-16=A(x-3)(x+1)+B(3x+2)(x+1)+C(3x+2)(x-3).\n$$\n\nFor $x=-\\frac{2}{3}$, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}13{(-\\frac{2}{3})}^{2}-19(-\\frac{2}{3})-16 & =A(-\\frac{2}{3}-3)(-\\frac{2}{3}+1) \\\\  & \\,+B(3(-\\frac{2}{3})+2)(-\\frac{2}{3}+1) \\\\  & \\,+C(3(-\\frac{2}{3})+1)(-\\frac{2}{3}-3) \\\\ \\frac{52}{9}+\\frac{38}{3}-16 & =A(\\frac{(-11)(1)}{9}) \\\\ \\frac{52+114-144}{9} & =A(-\\frac{11}{9}) \\\\ A & =-\\frac{22}{11} \\\\ A & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $x=3$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}13(3)^{2}-19(3)-16 & =A(3-3)(3+1) \\\\  & \\,+B(3(3)+2)(3+1) \\\\  & \\,+C(3(3)+2)(3-3) \\\\ 117-57-16 & =B(44) \\\\ B & =\\frac{44}{44} \\\\ B & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $x=-1$, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}13(-1)^{2}-19(-1)-16 & =A(-1-3)(-1+1) \\\\  & \\,+B(3(-1)+2)(-1+1) \\\\  & \\,+C(3(-1)+2)(-1-3) \\\\ 13+19-16 & =C(4) \\\\ C & =\\frac{16}{4} \\\\ C & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A+B+C & =(-2)+1+4=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-10988/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7e66d7cf-1a4b-51e6-9c78-f70a8c0555df"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-10988"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-351021/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "4ff9dfce-adb7-537c-8233-3a021329fadc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-351021/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "c880ea29-f063-547c-b54f-94ece1dccf2d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-351021/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer-field/choices ["q-351021/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-351021/field-2/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "a9d18b1d-0de4-5542-a385-ce43f89e72d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-351021/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "444b0666-38e4-597b-bb69-2acc4d8be561" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-351021/field-2/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer-field/choices ["q-351021/field-2/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-351021/field-3/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "2c4ea336-0017-5ee6-96ab-c98cd9a91713" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-351021/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "909ea992-942a-534b-9425-8537e4e4468a" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-351021/field-3/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer-field/choices ["q-351021/field-3/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-351021" :question/id #uuid "44ef4936-3dea-54c1-850a-c1dc4cb391c0" :question/math-academy-id "q-351021" :question/problem "Express $\\frac{2{x}^{2}+11x+7}{(x-1)(x+3)(x+4)}$ as a sum of partial fractions.\n\n| $\\frac{2{x}^{2}+11x+7}{(x-1)(x+3)(x+4)}=\\,$ | {{field-1}} | $+$ | {{field-2}} | $-$ | {{field-3}} |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $x-1$ |  | $x+3$ |  | $x+4$ |" :question/worked-solution "Our task is to find $A,$ $B,$ and $C$ such that\n\n$$\n\\frac{2{x}^{2}+11x+7}{(x-1)(x+3)(x+4)}=\\frac{A}{x-1}+\\frac{B}{x+3}+\\frac{C}{x+4}.\n$$\n\nMultiplying both sides by $(x-1)(x+3)(x+4)$ gives\n\n$$\n2{x}^{2}+11x+7=A(x+3)(x+4)+B(x-1)(x+4)+C(x-1)(x+3).\n$$\n\nFor $x=1,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(1)^{2}+11(1)+7 & =A(1+3)(1+4)+B(1-1)(1+4)+C(1-1)(1+3) \\\\ 20 & =20A \\\\ A & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $x=-3,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(-3)^{2}+11(-3)+7 & =A(-3+3)(-3+4)+B(-3-1)(-3+4)+C(-3-1)(-3+3) \\\\ -8 & =-4B \\\\ B & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $x=-4$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(-4)^{2}+11(-4)+7 & =A(-4+3)(-4+4)+B(-4-1)(-4+4)+C(-4-1)(-4+3) \\\\ -5 & =5C \\\\ C & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{2{x}^{2}+11x+7}{(x-1)(x+3)(x+4)}=\\frac{1}{x-1}+\\frac{2}{x+3}-\\frac{1}{x+4}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-351021/field-1" "q-351021/field-2" "q-351021/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7e66d7cf-1a4b-51e6-9c78-f70a8c0555df"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-351021"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
